Nonsense.

578
00:45:39,240 --> 00:45:39,520
Mr. Gu.

579
00:45:40,320 --> 00:45:40,480
Yes.

580
00:45:44,300 --> 00:45:46,960
Sasha is our money tree.

581
00:45:47,060 --> 00:45:48,980
We have to get it back.

582
00:45:50,380 --> 00:45:52,140
Otherwise, don't come back to see me.

583
00:45:56,510 --> 00:45:56,990
Yes.

584
00:45:57,810 --> 00:45:58,710
Do it right now.

585
00:46:08,440 --> 00:46:09,400
You're a good boy.

586
00:46:11,200 --> 00:46:13,220
The girl you introduced to me just now has
run away again.

587
00:46:13,220 --> 00:46:14,320
I didn't take her away.

588
00:46:14,400 --> 00:46:15,600
Then why did she run away?

589
00:46:15,800 --> 00:46:16,620
How do we know?

590
00:46:16,760 --> 00:46:17,440
It's none of my business.

591
00:46:18,040 --> 00:46:18,220
Tell me.

592
00:46:19,180 --> 00:46:20,860
Whichever family gives more money,
just do it there.

593
00:46:21,760 --> 00:46:22,620
Do you know the rules?

594
00:46:27,890 --> 00:46:30,110
Hey, do you want a top-notch one?

595
00:46:33,580 --> 00:46:35,160
We'll live in an apartment.

596
00:46:36,260 --> 00:46:37,760
We'll let you go when we've had enough.

597
00:46:38,520 --> 00:46:39,260
What do you say?

598
00:46:40,600 --> 00:46:41,180
Bastard.

599
00:46:41,260 --> 00:46:41,760
Go, go, go.

600
00:46:42,320 --> 00:46:42,920
Damn it.

601
00:46:44,020 --> 00:46:44,220
Let's go.

602
00:46:53,890 --> 00:46:54,470
Hello.

603
00:46:56,470 --> 00:46:57,290
Mr. Gu.

604
00:46:58,790 --> 00:47:00,190
Are you free today?

605
00:47:00,730 --> 00:47:01,810
I want to meet you.

606
00:47:02,570 --> 00:47:03,490
I'm not free today.

607
00:47:03,770 --> 00:47:04,690
I have a holiday tomorrow.

608
00:47:05,110 --> 00:47:07,130
But I have a date with Jenny.

609
00:47:07,830 --> 00:47:08,730
That's even better.

610
00:47:08,730 --> 00:47:09,590
All right, Xiao Zhou.

611
00:47:09,910 --> 00:47:14,210
Since you met Jenny, I haven't invited you
yet.

612
00:47:14,830 --> 00:47:15,430
So...

613
00:47:15,430 --> 00:47:15,930
All right, all right.

614
00:47:16,270 --> 00:47:16,930
I'm busy.

615
00:47:17,550 --> 00:47:18,710
We'll meet at the usual place tomorrow.

616
00:47:19,250 --> 00:47:19,550
Goodbye.

617
00:47:23,820 --> 00:47:25,140
Don't mention it, Miss Zhang.

618
00:47:25,960 --> 00:47:27,020
Xiao Zhou is my brother.

619
00:47:27,660 --> 00:47:29,660
You are not strangers, of course.

620
00:47:30,880 --> 00:47:33,240
I heard about your relationship from
Zhiqiang.

621
00:47:35,680 --> 00:47:37,480
He's been with me since I was a kid.

622
00:47:37,480 --> 00:47:40,780
He's been eating, fighting, and talking to
me.

623
00:47:42,040 --> 00:47:42,820
That's it.

624
00:47:48,060 --> 00:47:51,280
Now, he's a decent man.

625
00:47:52,280 --> 00:47:56,660
As his brother, I'm still wandering in the
dark.

626
00:47:59,380 --> 00:48:00,900
Then why don't you follow him?

627
00:48:01,400 --> 00:48:02,230
Follow him?

628
00:48:02,770 --> 00:48:03,480
Follow him.

629
00:48:04,060 --> 00:48:07,140
From now on, I must find a way to make a
living.

630
00:48:08,320 --> 00:48:10,540
Brother, thank you for your encouragement.

631
00:48:11,320 --> 00:48:12,200
Come on, let's drink.

632
00:48:17,870 --> 00:48:19,390
Did you go to a clothing store to find
him?

633
00:48:21,090 --> 00:48:22,450
Today is a holiday.

634
00:48:22,570 --> 00:48:23,590
There's no one there.

635
00:48:25,150 --> 00:48:25,950
Where did he go?

636
00:48:28,550 --> 00:48:29,430
How would I know?

637
00:48:32,800 --> 00:48:33,640
Damn it.

638
00:48:34,620 --> 00:48:35,620
He's still with that kid.

639
00:48:48,140 --> 00:48:50,260
My brother is the best at taking photos.

640
00:48:51,500 --> 00:48:53,020
Come on, let's take a photo for Miss
Zhang.

641
00:48:54,020 --> 00:48:54,580
Xiao Zhou, come here.

642
00:49:16,150 --> 00:49:16,750
Brother,

643
00:49:20,950 --> 00:49:21,550
look.

644
00:49:29,750 --> 00:49:30,790
There's an ad at the door.

645
00:49:31,590 --> 00:49:32,930
It's your sister's photo.

646
00:49:33,230 --> 00:49:33,970
Her name is Li Li.

647
00:49:39,890 --> 00:49:40,810
Damn it.

648
00:49:41,270 --> 00:49:42,390
I'm going to smash his place.

649
00:49:42,950 --> 00:49:43,590
Don't move.

650
00:50:01,750 --> 00:50:02,950
How dare you!

651
00:50:02,950 --> 00:50:03,850
How dare you betray Qingzhou?

652
00:50:05,130 --> 00:50:05,990
What are you talking about?

653
00:50:06,190 --> 00:50:06,750
Let go of me.

654
00:50:06,790 --> 00:50:07,670
You let them take advantage of me.

655
00:50:07,770 --> 00:50:08,610
You let them take revenge on me.

656
00:50:08,810 --> 00:50:09,690
You are humiliating me.

657
00:50:10,090 --> 00:50:10,870
What are you talking about?

658
00:50:11,430 --> 00:50:12,190
I'm telling you.

659
00:50:12,710 --> 00:50:14,150
You are not allowed to be with Qingzhou
anymore.

660
00:50:14,810 --> 00:50:16,830
If I see you again, I'm going to beat you
to death.

661
00:50:17,630 --> 00:50:18,330
Listen to me.

662
00:50:19,050 --> 00:50:19,730
There's nothing to say.

663
00:50:19,970 --> 00:50:20,610
Listen to me.

664
00:50:21,170 --> 00:50:21,870
Listen to me.

665
00:50:23,150 --> 00:50:24,050
It's all a fact.

666
00:50:24,450 --> 00:50:25,290
There's nothing to explain.

667
00:50:25,470 --> 00:50:25,930
I won't listen.

668
00:50:26,150 --> 00:50:26,570
I won't listen.

669
00:50:45,570 --> 00:50:46,570
Don't worry about Qingzhou.

670
00:50:46,730 --> 00:50:47,310
Do you hear me?

671
00:50:47,310 --> 00:50:48,350
Do you hear me?

672
00:50:49,710 --> 00:50:50,670
Do you hear me?

673
00:50:52,330 --> 00:50:52,850
Jin

674
00:51:01,410 --> 00:51:02,910
Mi, come here.

675
00:51:18,760 --> 00:51:20,080
Don't be sad, Jin Mi.

676
00:51:20,760 --> 00:51:22,200
You can stay in my house.

677
00:51:23,260 --> 00:51:25,180
How can your brother be so unreasonable?

678
00:51:25,640 --> 00:51:26,420
He beat my sister.

679
00:51:27,120 --> 00:51:28,920
I've never seen such a man.

680
00:51:30,200 --> 00:51:31,520
I'll go to him right now.

681
00:51:31,560 --> 00:51:32,980
I'll ask him why he beat you.

682
00:51:33,340 --> 00:51:34,060
Don't go.

683
00:51:34,540 --> 00:51:35,420
I'm not afraid of him.

684
00:51:36,580 --> 00:51:37,720
You want to make trouble again?

685
00:51:38,820 --> 00:51:40,820
You promised me you wouldn't fight again.

686
00:51:41,560 --> 00:51:42,100
Did you forget?

687
00:51:43,920 --> 00:51:44,940
I won't look for him.

688
00:51:45,440 --> 00:51:46,300
He will look for me.

689
00:52:32,190 --> 00:52:33,850
Is my sister here?

690
00:52:34,250 --> 00:52:34,510
No.

691
00:52:34,950 --> 00:52:35,750
Where did she go?

692
00:52:36,490 --> 00:52:37,830
She hasn't come to work for a few days.

693
00:52:38,490 --> 00:52:39,090
What?

694
00:52:39,510 --> 00:52:41,030
She hasn't come to work for a few days?

695
00:52:41,110 --> 00:52:41,570
Yes.

696
00:52:42,230 --> 00:52:43,190
Do you know where she is?

697
00:52:43,710 --> 00:52:44,130
I'm sorry.

698
00:52:44,390 --> 00:52:44,870
I don't know either.

699
00:52:45,490 --> 00:52:47,150
Okay, let's go.

700
00:53:34,780 --> 00:53:36,020
Which lady do you like?

701
00:53:36,580 --> 00:53:39,640
Is there a new lady named Lily here?

702
00:53:39,860 --> 00:53:41,060
Yes, please go inside.

703
00:53:52,200 --> 00:53:53,020
Please go inside.

704
00:53:53,480 --> 00:53:54,360
I'll call her right away.

705
00:54:30,710 --> 00:54:31,750
Come on.

706
00:54:36,130 --> 00:54:37,250
My guess was right.

707
00:54:37,670 --> 00:54:39,230
These two guys really came to work.

708
00:55:04,200 --> 00:55:05,860
Okay, this is my business.

709
00:55:07,300 --> 00:55:08,440
I'll take care of it myself.

710
00:55:10,400 --> 00:55:12,040
Jianmin, you can't go alone.

711
00:55:12,320 --> 00:55:13,100
Don't stop me.

712
00:55:14,940 --> 00:55:15,920
There's a tiger on the mountain.

713
00:55:16,580 --> 00:55:17,900
I'm going to the tiger's mountain.

714
00:55:21,280 --> 00:55:22,180
Don't move.

715
00:55:28,580 --> 00:55:29,500
Go away.

716
00:55:44,670 --> 00:55:46,230
What can I do for you?

717
00:55:46,230 --> 00:55:47,370
I'm here to get some advice.

718
00:55:48,670 --> 00:55:51,290
Is it because of what happened to your
brother?

719
00:55:53,130 --> 00:55:54,930
No, it's a personal matter.

720
00:55:56,530 --> 00:55:59,090
It's about my sister's disappearance.

721
00:56:01,390 --> 00:56:03,270
It's a personal matter.

722
00:56:05,110 --> 00:56:07,250
We'd better talk outside.

723
00:56:08,110 --> 00:56:10,270
What time and place?

724
00:56:11,350 --> 00:56:12,040
Anywhere.

725
00:56:17,130 --> 00:56:20,510
12 o'clock in the evening, at the
restaurant in the suburb.

726
00:56:21,610 --> 00:56:22,490
Sit down.

727
00:56:23,470 --> 00:56:24,310
Sit down.

728
00:56:32,630 --> 00:56:36,450
Mr. Zhang, what can I do for you?

729
00:56:39,470 --> 00:56:41,150
You are too good.

730
00:56:42,350 --> 00:56:47,170
If you dare to hurt him, I'll kill you.

731
00:56:49,250 --> 00:56:55,310
If you don't hand him over, I'll fight you
to death.

732
00:56:56,770 --> 00:56:58,050
Do you hear me?

733
00:56:59,290 --> 00:56:59,890
Do you hear me?

734
00:56:59,890 --> 00:57:02,210
Do you hear

735
00:57:23,910 --> 00:57:23,910
me?

736
00:57:23,910 --> 00:57:25,530
Mr. Zhang, please.

737
00:57:37,400 --> 00:57:39,340
So what do we do now?

738
00:57:41,100 --> 00:57:44,420
As long as you hand over my sister,
you can do whatever you want.

739
00:57:53,150 --> 00:57:59,890
I'll give you the land you dug,
and I'll pay you 10,000 yuan as a loss.

740
00:58:04,830 --> 00:58:05,310
What do you say?

741
00:58:06,690 --> 00:58:07,450
When?

742
00:58:08,790 --> 00:58:09,170
Anytime.

743
00:58:09,170 --> 00:58:09,270
What time?

744
00:58:11,370 --> 00:58:13,590
10 o'clock in the evening, at the suburb.

745
00:58:14,050 --> 00:58:14,910
Keep your word.

746
00:58:25,830 --> 00:58:30,150
Zhao, if you have enough friends,
hand over Zhang's sister right away.

747
00:58:34,110 --> 00:58:34,530
What do you say?

748
00:58:44,360 --> 00:58:47,460
Mr. Gu, I really despise you.

749
00:58:47,960 --> 00:58:48,400
What do you mean?

750
00:58:49,800 --> 00:58:53,060
Not only are you not kind, but you are
also very strict.

751
00:58:53,640 --> 00:58:54,260
What do you mean?

752
00:58:55,680 --> 00:58:57,680
Aren't you using Zhen Ni as a sacrifice
now?

753
00:59:08,930 --> 00:59:09,630
I won't bother you.

754
00:59:17,450 --> 00:59:19,210
Are you making clothes?

755
00:59:19,770 --> 00:59:22,810
No, I'm looking for Zhen Ni's whereabouts.

756
00:59:23,030 --> 00:59:24,110
We don't know.

757
00:59:24,490 --> 00:59:25,550
You must know.

758
00:59:30,240 --> 00:59:32,200
Please inform her right away.

759
00:59:32,800 --> 00:59:34,760
Call me before 10 o'clock tonight.

760
00:59:36,960 --> 00:59:39,100
Remember, don't ignore it.

761
00:59:40,480 --> 00:59:41,160
Go.

762
01:00:02,130 --> 01:00:05,570
Zhen Ni, Mr. Gu came to see you just now.

763
01:00:06,770 --> 01:00:07,690
He came to see me?

764
01:00:08,270 --> 01:00:09,730
He asked you to call him before 10 o
'clock.

765
01:00:12,870 --> 01:00:14,810
Something must have happened.

766
01:00:22,430 --> 01:00:24,070
Why did he come to see me?

767
01:00:39,920 --> 01:00:42,680
Mr. Gu came to see you, so I guess Zhen Ni
is here.

768
01:00:58,500 --> 01:00:59,580
Don't look for me.

769
01:01:00,160 --> 01:01:03,740
If I can't find you tonight, many people
will die.

770
01:01:03,740 --> 01:01:05,200
Zhen Ni, it's none of my business if you
want to fight or kill.

771
01:01:06,300 --> 01:01:07,460
It's your business.

772
01:01:07,700 --> 01:01:08,420
I don't care.

773
01:01:08,740 --> 01:01:09,440
You can't ignore it.

774
01:01:10,230 --> 01:01:12,660
Zhen Ni, you shouldn't hate your brother.

775
01:01:13,320 --> 01:01:14,420
You shouldn't run away from home.

776
01:01:15,180 --> 01:01:16,230
He can't hide it from you.

777
01:01:18,270 --> 01:01:19,900
No, he cares about you.

778
01:01:20,140 --> 01:01:21,980
He cares about your reputation and future.

779
01:01:24,240 --> 01:01:25,040
Do you know?

780
01:01:25,440 --> 01:01:27,180
That guy named Gu is framing you.

781
01:01:28,140 --> 01:01:31,360
He took a picture of you, causing him to
deal with your brother's conspiracy.

782
01:01:31,360 --> 01:01:31,380
No.

783
01:01:32,160 --> 01:01:35,500
He took your picture and posted it at the
door of the hotel.

784
01:01:35,800 --> 01:01:37,000
He is the one who set you up.

785
01:02:01,820 --> 01:02:03,740
I don't think Zhen Ni will call.

786
01:02:06,220 --> 01:02:09,200
If she doesn't come now, we will be
embarrassed.

787
01:02:19,290 --> 01:02:23,110
Mr. Gu took advantage of you, and framed
your brother.

788
01:02:24,070 --> 01:02:26,750
And it caused a tense situation tonight.

789
01:02:30,700 --> 01:02:32,020
I'm going to find Mr. Gu.

790
01:02:33,160 --> 01:02:34,760
No, don't go.

791
01:02:35,620 --> 01:02:36,680
Why are you stopping me?

792
01:02:38,120 --> 01:02:38,880
It's no use for you to go.

793
01:02:45,570 --> 01:02:47,090
I will solve this matter.

794
01:03:00,600 --> 01:03:01,600
Is Gu Xiong here?

795
01:03:04,160 --> 01:03:04,680
Okay.

796
01:03:07,570 --> 01:03:08,450
They just left.

797
01:03:09,270 --> 01:03:10,530
They must have gone to the drying plant.

798
01:03:12,770 --> 01:03:13,550
I'll go to the guardhouse.

799
01:03:16,050 --> 01:03:17,990
Mary, go home with Zhen Ni first.

800
01:03:17,990 --> 01:03:18,130
Go home.

801
01:03:23,480 --> 01:03:27,750
Zhen Ni, as long as I get there,
everything will be clear.

802
01:03:30,350 --> 01:03:33,690
From now on, your brother will understand
us.

803
01:05:20,170 --> 01:05:24,750
Mr. Gu, you brought the money and people
you wanted.

804
01:05:56,660 --> 01:05:59,560
What about our brother Zhang's sister,
Zhen Ni?

805
01:06:05,040 --> 01:06:06,350
Oh, this matter.

806
01:06:10,310 --> 01:06:10,430
Oh.

807
01:06:13,230 --> 01:06:15,290
Brother Zhang's sister is not feeling
well.

808
01:06:15,390 --> 01:06:15,990
She is resting in a place.

809
01:06:17,250 --> 01:06:18,510
I will send her back in three days.

810
01:06:18,770 --> 01:06:19,430
What did you say?

811
01:06:20,010 --> 01:06:20,650
Say it again.

812
01:06:21,890 --> 01:06:22,830
Don't be anxious.

813
01:06:24,210 --> 01:06:25,590
We are just going out for a walk.

814
01:06:25,950 --> 01:06:26,790
It's not a big deal.

815
01:06:27,350 --> 01:06:28,050
Three days.

816
01:06:28,530 --> 01:06:29,250
Three days?

817
01:06:30,770 --> 01:06:31,730
It's not a big deal.

818
01:06:40,310 --> 01:06:44,450
Do you dare to hit me?

819
01:06:44,450 --> 01:06:45,910
Do you dare to hit me?

820
01:06:55,570 --> 01:06:56,270
Do you dare to hit me?

821
01:06:58,950 --> 01:07:00,370
Listen to me, sister.

822
01:07:00,550 --> 01:07:01,030
Do not hit him.

823
01:07:01,110 --> 01:07:01,490
Darn it.

824
01:07:04,650 --> 01:07:05,210
Stop.

825
01:07:05,530 --> 01:07:06,530
You shouldn't hit the face.

826
01:07:08,690 --> 01:07:09,830
Don't hit him.

827
01:07:12,010 --> 01:07:14,030
Don't hit him.

828
01:07:14,710 --> 01:07:15,370
Don't hit him.

829
01:07:15,730 --> 01:07:16,250
Don't hit him.

830
01:07:17,470 --> 01:07:18,210
Let go of me.

831
01:07:40,410 --> 01:07:42,150
You murderer, you should listen to my
explanation.

832
01:07:42,450 --> 01:07:43,350
You shouldn't have killed him.

833
01:08:15,890 --> 01:08:16,330
Go.

834
01:08:25,600 --> 01:08:26,040
Go.

835
01:08:27,340 --> 01:08:31,040
Let go of me.

836
01:08:37,630 --> 01:08:40,050
Get in the car.

837
01:09:05,060 --> 01:09:06,460
You...

838
01:09:08,510 --> 01:09:11,870
If only this wish could come true.

839
01:09:13,070 --> 01:09:15,770
How beautiful, how happy.

840
01:09:21,040 --> 01:09:23,200
And how free and comfortable.

841
01:09:24,720 --> 01:09:25,280
Mary.

842
01:09:30,500 --> 01:09:32,100
You married my brother.

843
01:09:32,280 --> 01:09:33,100
I married Zhiqiang.

844
01:09:33,940 --> 01:09:35,460
We have a good job.

845
01:09:35,620 --> 01:09:36,720
We live together.

846
01:09:39,280 --> 01:09:41,340
Mary, don't you want to live like this?

847
01:09:44,380 --> 01:09:47,760
Mary, at that time, my brother was no
longer used by the villains.

848
01:09:48,820 --> 01:09:50,200
He could raise his head and be a human
being.

849
01:09:50,200 --> 01:09:52,040
He could be a real man.

850
01:10:01,120 --> 01:10:05,460
I'm afraid your brother won't be alive to
enjoy those days.

851
01:10:10,290 --> 01:10:11,830
Shaofu, what happened?

852
01:10:13,710 --> 01:10:14,310
Jieming...

853
01:10:14,310 --> 01:10:16,270
Jieming, he...

854
01:10:16,270 --> 01:10:17,450
He...

